Switching the tabs feels slow because it forces the slowed down `List` to re-render. That’s expected because the `tab` has changed, and so you need to reflect the user’s new choice on the screen.
Next, try toggling the theme. **Thanks to`useMemo` together with [`memo`](https://18.react.dev/reference/react/memo), it’s fast despite the artificial slowdown!** The `List` skipped re-rendering because the `visibleTodos` array has not changed since the last render. The `visibleTodos` array has not changed because both `todos` and `tab` (which you pass as dependencies to `useMemo`) haven’t changed since the last render.
