  <TasksDispatchContext value={dispatch}>



    <h1>Day off in Kyoto</h1>



    <AddTask />



    <TaskList />



  </TasksDispatchContext>




</TasksContext>


```

Instead, any component that needs the task list can read it from the `TasksContext`:
```


