Adding a dependency on `onReceiveMessage` is not ideal because it will cause the chat to re-connect every time the component re-renders. [Wrap this event handler into an Effect Event to remove it from the dependencies:](https://18.react.dev/learn/removing-effect-dependencies#wrapping-an-event-handler-from-the-props)
