Luckily, React 18 includes a dedicated API called [`useSyncExternalStore`](https://18.react.dev/reference/react/useSyncExternalStore) which takes care of all of these problems for you. Here is how your `useOnlineStatus` Hook, rewritten to take advantage of this new API:
